Package: sparrow-hawk-watchdog-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, busybox, systemd
Description: RWDT watchdog configuration for Sparrow Hawk
 Provide rwdt-watchdog.service that allows the RWDT reset of R-Car V4H
 in the RST block and enables the systemd runtime watchdog.
 .
 The service is disabled by default. Run
 'systemctl enable --now rwdt-watchdog.service' to enable it.
